# French (AZERTY, ISO).
# Digits are on Shift, as on a real French keyboard.
# Not available (no glyph yet): e/a/u accents, c cedilla, superscript two,
# degree, pound, micro and paragraph signs. Dead keys are not supported:
# ^ types itself, the diaeresis key types nothing.
name French (AZERTY)
# SC  plain shift altgr
29    none  none
02    &     1
03    none  2      ~
04    "     3      #
05    '     4      {
06    (     5      [
07    -     6      |
08    none  7      `
09    _     8      \
0A    none  9      ^
0B    none  0      @
0C    )     none   ]
0D    =     +      }
10    a     A
11    z     Z
1A    ^     none
1B    $     none
1E    q     Q
27    m     M
28    none  %
2B    *     none
56    <     >
2C    w     W
32    ,     ?
33    ;     .
34    :     /
35    !     none
